#* {{quote-journal|en|author=David Yaffe-Bellany|title=The Rise of the Crypto Mayors|work=The New York Times|date=2022-01-25|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2022/01/25/business/crypto-mayors.html|issn=0362-4331|passage={{...|And the mayors’ aims are partly political:}} Crypto boosterism has a useful bipartisan appeal, garnering popularity among both antigovernment conservatives and socially liberal tech '''moguls'''.}}

